  triage:title "codex-orchestration/SKILL.md's Stacked Phases section opens with conditional framing but closes by declaring stacking mandatory" ;
  triage:description "quality-mgr BB2-QA2-1789248000 (Final verdict FAIL, https://github.com/randlee/atm-core/pull/1444#issuecomment-5648627854, 2026-09-12T20:54:11Z; M3, arch-qa ARCH-003), reviewed at ef7572fd0. codex-orchestration/SKILL.md's 'Stacked Phases' section opens with conditional framing ('When a phase runs as a gh stack...') but its own closing sentence declares stacking mandatory ('the default for every phase, not an option'); graph-orchestration/SKILL.md's parallel section states the rule unconditionally throughout. Internally inconsistent framing, no functional impact." ;
